  {
   "sectionKind": "discussion",
   "heading": "Discussion",
   "contentText": "Discussion\nUse this endpoint to get transaction information for any transaction identifier, including original transaction identifiers.  This endpoint supports all in-app purchase types, including consumable, non-consumable, non-renewing subscriptions, and auto-renewable subscriptions. It also supports transactions that your app marked as finished using finish() or finishTransaction(_:) in StoreKit.\n",
   "contentJson": [
